==Damage Type Modifiers==
{{Main|Damage Type Modifier}}
[[Damage Type Modifier]]s are a unique classification of damage reduction that is usually specific to only one type of damage. Damage modifiers stack '''multiplicatively''' with each other and other sources of '''damage reduction'''.

