==Quick Thinking and Gladiator Finesse==
{{M|Quick Thinking}} and {{M|Gladiator Finesse}} are mods that convert a percentage of lethal damage taken into energy drain when the player reaches 2 health. At above 100% efficiency, additional lethal damage taken will be reduced. With both mods at maxed rank equipped, your Warframe's energy pool will be 300% efficient in absorbing damage, reducing incoming damage by 66.67%.

To calculate the multiplier on incoming damage:
<math>\text{Multiplier on incoming damage} = \frac{100}{\text{Net efficiency percentage}}</math>

To calculate damage reduction provided by these mods:
<math>\text{Damage reduction percentage} = (1 - \text{Multiplier on incoming damage}) \times 100</math>

